      <strong>Plain-Language Summary:</strong> You do not need to create an account or provide any personal information to use this website. We serve informational menu reviews, pricing guides, and nutritional data freely to all visitors. We use Google Analytics to monitor traffic performance and Google advertising services (including Google Ad Manager / Google AdSense) to display ads. These third-party technologies utilize cookies to serve ads based on your web activity. You may opt out of personalized tracking at any time as explained in Section 6, and you may contact us with any privacy requests at <a href="mailto:hello@thequeendairymenu.us">hello@thequeendairymenu.us</a>.
